  "description": "Milo is sure everyone is staring at the coffee stain on his shirt. Almost nobody noticed. Psychologists call this the spotlight effect: in a Cornell study (Gilovich, Medvec & Savitsky, 2000) students wearing an embarrassing T-shirt guessed about half the room noticed; only about a quarter did. #psychology #shorts #socialanxiety",
